          "sourceId": "Item.bXl361asqDDzZnLf"
        }
      },
      "system": {
        "description": "<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">Dogmeat's Initiative is the same as yours. His carry weight is 50 lbs. Dogmeat&rsquo;s level is the same as yours and increases whenever you level up. Increase either Dogmeat&rsquo;s Body or Mind by +1 when you reach level 3 or any odd numbered level after that. Increase Dogmeat&rsquo;s HP by +1 per level, and with any increases to Body. Increase Dogmeat&rsquo;s bite damage by +1</span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">CD</span><span class=\"fontstyle2\" style=\"color: #1d4596;\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">at 5th level and every 5 levels beyond that.</span> <br style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: -webkit-auto; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\" /><br /></p>",
